":{"m":[[{"t":"Não podemos deixar escapar uma oportunidade divina destas.","e":"A God given opportunity like this, we cannot let it pass.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.799535,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"b0f3335e7686ef792b5e7279977b4d23","i":"01e714079c93b1f9635c9f4a7b9b2a71","r":"3565780:6228663:368:429458","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3565780","6228663","368"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Se não fosse um acto de intervenção divina, estaria morto.","e":"Hey, who's your friend? Did you find it?","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.109966,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"b67448c8b470755121cad3e89c1d165e","i":"6791e5b36a43f0b2ebf267b0ff1b38a7","r":"4550146:6982658:635:1686500","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4550146","6982658","635"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"O que é bom, se acreditar em ajuda divina.","e":"Which is good, if you like worms.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.425895,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"731dd7457bc24a41cc423df25d3116c5","i":"859e897e02f22761f7a32937f55bbad6","r":"4462682:6722760:644:2735605","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["4462682","6722760","644"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Estamos a ficar sem tempo, sem opções e sem essência divina.","e":"We are running out of time and options and god jizz.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.756929,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"177e58169a040497b7ebb4c5c53705a8","i":"a94f54ecf76493b3f124d74c8730fb23","r":"6052166:6903219:451:4877425","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["6052166","6903219","451"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Escolho ver a perfeição divina, em todas as células do meu corpo.","e":"I choose to see the divine perfection in every cell of my body.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.87067,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x